· Gemini）\n- 分镜提示词由平台 LLM 节点【RHLLMChatNode】生成：它能看到参考图1-3（image1-3）+ 拼接好的分镜指令与故事主题，人物一致性有保障；\n- 『分镜引擎』开关：开=走 Gemini 写词；关=跳过 LLM，直接用『拼接』的模板+主题原文当提示词（LLM 报错时的逃生通道）；\n- model 当前为 google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview，可在节点下拉里更换；max_tokens 已是 4096；\n- 若平台要求 API 配置，把 RH 的 OpenAPI 配置节点连到该节点的 api_config 输入口；\n- 本地看图 LLM（qwen3.5 PE 模型）已移除，不再加载，省一份显存。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1000, 340], "pos": [-22.691251754760742, -846.8748168945312], "id": 61, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [65, 69], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [330, 166], "pos": [1932.16015625, -16.59364891052246], "widgets_values": ["", "", "\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "string_a"}, "name": "string_a", "link": 17, "label": "string_a", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string_a"}, {"widget": {"name": "string_b"}, "name": "string_b", "link": 18, "label": "string_b", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string_b"}, {"widget": {"name": "delimiter"}, "name": "delimiter", "label": "delimiter", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "delimiter"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "StringConcatenate", "title": "拼接：分镜指令+故事主题", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.37.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"string_b": true, "string_a": true}, "Node name for S&R": "StringConcatenate"}, "order": 34}, {"outputs": [{"name": "BOOLEAN", "links": [64], "label": "BOOLEAN", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "BOOLEAN"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveBoolean", "title": "分镜引擎：开=Gemini看图写词 / 关=跳过LLM直出", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 120], "pos": [55.05765914916992, 1811.75634765625], "id": 64, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveBoolean"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [14], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [240, 90], "pos": [1995.7529296875, -133.9222869873047], "widgets_values": [false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "on_false", "link": 13, "label": "on_false", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "on_true", "link": 12, "label": "on_true", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "link": 16, "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {}, "id": 24, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "title": "指令选择B：六宫格？", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.36.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"switch": true}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [13], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [460, 300], "pos": [1373.4892578125, 436.0225830078125], "widgets_values": ["你是一名顶级AI分镜导演。请仔细观察参考图中的人物形象、服装与画风并严格保持一致，然后根据下面的故事主题，创作一张【四宫格分镜图】的文生图提示词。\n硬性要求：\n1. 画面是一张完整的2×2 四宫格（每格横版宽幅电影构图）拼图，共4格，格子之间用极细的白色分隔线均匀隔开；\n2. 4格按从左到右、从上到下的顺序连续讲述完整故事，节奏为：开端→发展→高潮→结局；\n3. 所有格子统一画风与色调，人物形象、服装与参考图严格一致；除剧情明确需要双人同框外，每一格中主角只出现一次，严禁在同一格内重复绘制相同人物或其分身；\n4. 景别交替变化（远景/中景/近景/特写交替），电影级构图与光影；\n5. 画面中禁止出现任何文字、字幕、序号、水印。\n输出要求：直接输出最终文生图提示词（中文），第一句点明这是一张2×2 四宫格（每格横版宽幅电影构图）分镜图，然后逐格描述第1格到第4格的画面内容（每格包含主体、动作、场景、镜头景别；每格一到两句，精炼不啰嗦）。不要输出任何解释。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 22, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "模板：四宫格分镜指令（2×2）", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [27, 32], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "INT"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [2048, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}